- Honeybee cryptochrome (Apis mellifera Cry2) shows greater magnetic sensitivity than Arabidopsis, enabling comparative studies [GH-C0E4596A11F4 L67].  
- System susceptibility (∂χ/∂nₑ) diverges at critical points during plasma density sweeps, modeled after brain criticality and solar wind turbulence [GH-C0E4596A11F4 L55].  

